---
title: Source and catalog acquisition
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Source and catalog acquisition
  accDescr: A user adds a locator for a source repository or a source. The catalog is browseable only. Packages appear after the user opts into a listed source. Git and artifact locators both produce a validated snapshot.

  User[User] -->|adds catalog locator| CatalogFetch[Fetch skill-manager-repository.json]
  CatalogFetch --> CatalogSnap[Source repository snapshot]
  CatalogSnap --> Browse[Browse listed locators]
  Browse -->|opt in| SourceFetch[Fetch listed source]
  User -->|adds source locator| SourceFetch
  SourceFetch --> Validate[Validate tree and skill-manager.json]
  Validate --> SourceSnap[Source snapshot]
  SourceSnap --> Packages[Packages in the main catalog]
